  "header_text": "HOME CALENDAR SONGWRITER NIGHTS ARTISTS VENUES ARTICLES PODCAST CONTACT DONATE",
  "footer_text": "BVLIVE. The Brazos Valley's most comprehensive concert calendar. We bring together every concert happening across the region, from local songwriters and rising bands to touring artists on big stages. LISTEN TO THE BVLIVE.COM PODCAST Spotify Apple Podcasts Amazon Music YouTube QUICK LINKS Concert Calendar Featured Artists Local Venues Podcast Songwriter Nights Contact Us Submit an Event CONTACT info@bvlive.com FOLLOW US Stay updated with the latest events and artist spotlights on our social media channels. © 2026 BV Live. All rights reserved. Privacy Terms Created by poweredbyplantain.com",
  "above_fold_text": "Home Calendar Songwriter Nights Artists Venues Articles Podcast Contact Donate Get in Touch Have a question about an event? Want to submit your band for a spotlight? Interested in becoming a sponsor? We'd love to hear from you. Send a Message Name Email Subject Message Connect With Us Follow us on social media for the latest updates on live music events, artist spotlights, and community news. Email Us Directly info@bvlive.com booking@bvlive.com",
  "visible_text": "HOME\nCALENDAR\nSONGWRITER NIGHTS\nARTISTS\nVENUES\nARTICLES\nPODCAST\nCONTACT\nDONATE\nGET IN TOUCH\n\nHave a question about an event? Want to submit your band for a spotlight? Interested in becoming a sponsor? We'd love to hear from you.\n\nSEND A MESSAGE\nName\nEmail\nSubject\nMessage\nSEND MESSAGE\nCONNECT WITH US\n\nFollow us on social media for the latest updates on live music events, artist spotlights, and community news.\n\nEMAIL US DIRECTLY\ninfo@bvlive.com\nbooking@bvlive.com\nSUBMIT YOUR EVENT\n\nAre you a venue or promoter? Submit your live music events to be featured on BV Live.\n\nGET STARTED\n\nFRIENDS OF BV LIVE\n\nBVLIVE.\n\nThe Brazos Valley's most comprehensive concert calendar. We bring together every concert happening across the region, from local songwriters and rising bands to touring artists on big stages.\n\nLISTEN TO THE BVLIVE.COM PODCAST\nSpotify\nApple Podcasts\nAmazon Music\nYouTube\nQUICK LINKS\nConcert Calendar\nFeatured Artists\nLocal Venues\nPodcast\nSongwriter Nights\nContact Us\nSubmit an Event\nCONTACT\ninfo@bvlive.com\nFOLLOW US\n\nStay updated with the latest events and artist spotlights on our social media channels.\n\n© 2026 BV Live. All rights reserved.\n\nPrivacy\nTerms\nCreated by poweredbyplantain.com",
